{"description":"Hire an OpenTrain proposal with ADMIN_BALANCE funding: creates the contract plus the ACTIVE_FUNDED initial milestone with internal-balance funding metadata. Zero money moves and no approval record is created; the later milestone approval/release that moves money stays human-only in the web app. Internal, default-off surface for verified OpenTrain admins in the canonical admin organization \u2014 the admin_balance_hire:create scope alone never grants access (the server independently verifies platform-admin status, the Admin Pay allowlist, canonical-org membership, and the proposal organization; everything fails closed). Request-bound idempotency: same idempotencyKey + payload converges; key reuse with a changed payload conflicts; concurrency cannot duplicate the contract. The response carries a live `onboarding` receipt for the new hire\u2019s auto-assigned Project To-dos (exact assignment readback, durable hook state, provider provisioning state; recomputed on every replay): `onboarding.status` COMPLETE is the only full success \u2014 PENDING, RETRYABLE_FAILED, or terminal FAILED is a PARTIAL SUCCESS: for PENDING/RETRYABLE_FAILED retry this tool with the SAME idempotencyKey to re-heal and re-check; for FAILED (error.retryable=false) follow error.remediation instead (a same-key retry cannot heal it); read opentrain_list_project_todos for the contract when you need current assignment truth. DEV-4500: the contract rate defaults to the applicant\u2019s bid unless you pass rateUsd; the contract is always created at the bid and a different rateUsd is proposed to the worker through the compensation-change flow (rate.status PENDING_WORKER_ACCEPTANCE) \u2014 a rate different from the bid needs the worker\u2019s acceptance and is never written silently. Pass hours (hourly proposals) to fund hours \u00d7 the bid with the hours recorded on the milestone; with both amountUsd and hours a mismatch is rejected. The response always echoes rate (contractRateUsd, bidRateUsd, postedRateUsd, requestedRateUsd, status) and warnings, e.g. when the bid differs from the job\u2019s posted rate.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amountUsd":{"description":"Milestone amount in USD. Optional when hours is given (then hours \u00d7 the bid).","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"description":{"description":"Milestone description.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"dueDate":{"description":"Optional ISO-8601 due date.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"hours":{"description":"Funded hours (hourly proposals only): the milestone amount is hours \u00d7 the contract rate (the bid) and the hours are recorded on the milestone. With both amountUsd and hours a mismatch is rejected.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"idempotencyKey":{"description":"Request-bound idempotency key (1-128 chars of letters, digits, dot, underscore, dash, colon). The same key with the same payload converges on the original result; reusing a key with a changed payload conflicts.","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]{1,128}$","type":"string"},"name":{"description":"Optional milestone name.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"proposalId":{"description":"OpenTrain proposal (job offer) id to hire with ADMIN_BALANCE funding.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"rateUsd":{"description":"Requested contract rate (USD/hour). Defaults to the applicant\u2019s bid; the contract is always created at the bid and a different rate is proposed to the worker (PENDING acceptance) \u2014 a rate different from the bid needs the worker\u2019s acceptance.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"}},"required":["idempotencyKey","description","proposalId"],"type":"object"},"name":"opentrain_create_admin_balance_hire","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"apiBaseUrl":{"type":"string"},"result":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"contractId":{"type":"string"},"fundingSource":{"const":"ADMIN_BALANCE","type":"string"},"humanApprovalRequired":{"const":false,"type":"boolean"},"idempotentReplay":{"type":"boolean"},"jobId":{"type":"string"},"milestone":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amountUsd":{"type":"number"},"fundingInvoiceId":{"type":["string","null"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string"},"volume":{"type":["number","null"]}},"required":["id","status","amountUsd","volume","fundingInvoiceId"],"type":"object"},"moneyMoved":{"const":false,"type":"boolean"},"onboarding":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"assignments":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"assignmentIds":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"createdAssignmentIds":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"createdCount":{"type":"integer"},"expectedCount":{"type":"integer"},"missingItemIds":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"presentCount":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["expectedCount","presentCount","createdCount","createdAssignmentIds","assignmentIds","missingItemIds"],"type":"object"},"contractId":{"type":"string"},"error":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"code":{"enum":["ONBOARDING_CONTRACT_NOT_OPEN","ONBOARDING_HOOK_FAILED","ONBOARDING_HOOK_CANCELLED","ONBOARDING_ASSIGNMENTS_MISSING","ONBOARDING_PROVISIONING_FAILED","ONBOARDING_PROVISIONING_RATE_LIMITED","ONBOARDING_PROVIDER_AUTHORITY_MISSING","ONBOARDING_TARGET_INVALID","ONBOARDING_RECONCILE_ERROR"],"type":"string"},"remediation":{"enum":["RETRY_SAME_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY","RESTORE_PROVIDER_MAPPING","CONTACT_SUPPORT"],"type":"string"},"retryAfterSeconds":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]},"retryable":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["code","retryable","retryAfterSeconds","remediation"],"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}]},"evaluatedAt":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"healed":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"createdCount":{"type":"integer"},"rearmed":{"type":"boolean"}},"r